<title>UK: Rentenbank add another 50 mln marks to reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>Rentenbank add another 50 mln marks to reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley AG has been increased.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *200 MLN DEM   COUPON  ***10.0	MATURITY    13.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE  REVERSE FRN    ISS PRICE**100.175   PAY DATE    13.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER  **98.00     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MILLION MARKS ON</p>
<p>21.OCT.96, THEN INCREASED BY 50 MILLION MARKS ON 25.OCT.96</p>
<p>AND NOW INCREASED BY A FURTHER 50 MILLION MARKS.</p>
<p>	    **NEW ISSUE AND REOFFER PRICE</p>
<p>	   ***FOR FIRST TWO YEARS, STEPPING UP TO 17 PCT LESS TWO</p>
<p>		TIMES 6M MARK LIBOR FLAT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
